    page_title: "Nine districts,<br><em>one country.</em>",
    page_intro: "From the sun-baked hills of Goriška Brda to the cool terraced vineyards of Štajerska, Slovenia packs an extraordinary range of terroirs into a country the size of a small Italian province. Three macro-regions, nine distinct districts — each shaped by its own soil, wind and winemaking tradition.",
